WEBVTT

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.840
I'm off!

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:06.440
Come home safe!

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:10.500
Is that Lala? She's up early.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:13.110
I'm sure she's excited.

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:32.330
There's nobody here, probably because it's early.

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:43.260
I wonder what Jululu's doing?

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:50.320
W-What's this?

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:03.930
I guess I'm leaving Parajuku again for a while.

00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:07.080
Falulu?

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:09.690
I've finished packing-dechu.

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:12.180
Since we're going back to PriParis today.

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:16.310
Yeah! I sure had fun at the Divine Idol Grand Prix!

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:20.790
There'll be more chances, you're only going to get better-dechu!

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:26.000
What's going on!? Somebody stop it!

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:27.530
Lala, good morning!

00:01:27.530 --> 00:01:28.600
Look out!
Lala, good morning!

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:36.610
Ouch... Sorry, Falulu.

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:39.360
Falulu?

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:41.410
She's gone-dechu!

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:43.800
Lala!

00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:44.990
Where is she?

00:01:45.220 --> 00:01:46.180
In here!

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.110
EHH!?

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:29.980
Everyone Friends!
Forever Friends!

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:38.640
Jululu's room is so much fun!

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:42.970
What's in here?

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:47.900
Falulu! I can't bear to see you like this-dechu!

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:50.710
What on earth have you done!?

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:52.690
I don't know, I just...

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:54.670
You get the horn!

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.770
If you don't want it, return Falulu back to normal-dechu!

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:00.480
Even if you ask I don't know how!

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:03.190
You got her in, you can get her out!

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:04.550
For me?

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:12.920
You!

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:15.720
Lala, Unicorn, look at this!

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:18.590
Jewlie's present!

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:22.300
Our school uniform? W-What for?

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:27.250
Falulu want's to wear this and go to the real world!

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:30.300
W-What are you going on about-dechu!?

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:33.580
Jululu went to the real world inside her rosette pact!

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:35.240
Ah! She did!

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:38.360
I know how Jululu feels.

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:41.760
She wanted to show Falulu the outside world!

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.130
Exactly right, Mama!

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:47.280
Capische Challenge!

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:49.260
H-H-HOLD ON!

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:04.770
I hope this works.

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:11.530
Falulu, are you okay?

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:20.860
So this is the outside world...

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:24.990
Lala!

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:27.510
You're so small!

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:28.940
You're so big!

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.810
It worked!

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:35.250
Falulu wants to go to school!

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:36.880
Capisce!

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:46.360
You called, so I've come!

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:49.360
I'm so happy you called, Curly-chan!

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:51.610
What do you need?

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:53.390
Ajimi-sama, please calm down.

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:55.180
Listen to me!

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:56.280
Ajimi-sensei.

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:57.770
Konkon.

00:05:57.770 --> 00:05:59.230
<i>Kon</i>gou monk statue.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:01.660
You can speak now, Hibiki-san.

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:07.460
I <i>really</i> didn't want to call you, but...

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.500
due to overwhelming sorrow, I had no choice.

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:16.400
Going to school with Falulu, I can't wait!

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:19.190
It would appear Falulu has left PriPara.

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:23.990
It's been Falulu's dream to go to school

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:25.530
and I want to make it come true.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:30.700
And so, today, I want you to teach a proper class!

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.920
Leave it to me!

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:36.040
No problem! I'll make sure Falulu has a lot of fun!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.900
STOP THAT!

00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:40.060
I told you not to use sentence enders!

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:42.820
No... sentence... enders...!?

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:48.550
Sentence enders are like breathing to Ajimi-sama.

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:49.990
I'm not sure it will be possible.

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:54.250
F-Fine...

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:58.070
As long as she can teach a proper class today...

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:03.150
She can be my friend's friend's friend's pet hamster!

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:07.280
Do you mean that-da...?

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:10.520
EH!?

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:12.500
Falulu has gone to the outside world-kuma!?

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:14.830
H-How warm is it outside-tori!?

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:16.330
Can you breathe-tori?

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:17.320
Do they have gravity-tori!?

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:19.290
This is never happened before-ucha!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.250
It should be live-streamed-nekon!

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:24.060
The arrangements have already been made

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:26.600
Stand!

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:28.630
Greet!

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:30.600
Good morning!

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:32.330
Be seated!

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:36.040
Good morning, students.

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:39.220
Let's study hard today!

00:07:39.510 --> 00:07:41.230
What's on earth...?

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:42.360
Who, and what...?

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:43.400
An upgrade?

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.780
The face and voice are definitely Miss Ajimi...

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:46.900
But there's no sentence enders.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.360
Is she an impostor?

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:49.180
No way!

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:54.040
We have a new transfer student today, come on in!

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:57.920
It's Falulu!

00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:00.090
She's left Pripara?

00:08:01.260 --> 00:08:05.110
Nice to meet you all, I'm Falulu!

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:06.400
It's Falulu!

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:07.250
It really is!

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:09.640
Hey! Do you remember me!?

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:11.930
Yes, I totally remember you!

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:16.570
When did you get to know Falulu, Takahashi?

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:19.160
I spoke to her through PriPass.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:21.860
The "not-representative of all boys" Takahashi-kun!

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:25.570
Now, Falulu-san.

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:27.930
Choose any empty seat.

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:28.520
Okay!

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:32.570
Sensei, we can't see the blackboard!

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:36.020
Really? Well...

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:38.520
Now you're okay.

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:40.820
Yes! Next to Lala!

00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:45.330
Now I'll take attendance...

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:47.330
Attendance?

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:52.300
Taking attendnace is proof that Falulu came to Paprika School.

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:53.640
You can do it!

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:55.170
Ehime-san?

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:55.670
Here!

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:56.840
Ooshima-san?

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:57.260
Here!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:00.240
You have to respond "here" when she calls your name-dechu.

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:02.910
I'm sure Falulu can do it-dechu!

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:05.890
Falulu's first attendance roll call

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:07.810
is quickly approaching!

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:10.340
You can do it if you try, Falulu-dechu!

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:14.060
"Ha" and "I" are both in Ham-Senpai's name-kuma!

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:16.680
Terayama-san?

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:17.170
Here!

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:18.450
Nakagawa-san?

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:19.010
Here!

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:20.620
It's almost here.

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:22.110
Falulu-san?

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:22.830
Now!

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:23.610
Say it loud!

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:25.870
DO IT!

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:27.310
Here!

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:28.950
Capisce! Perfect!

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:29.600
Great.

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:38.430
Falulu has ranked up to Sparkling New Student!

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.240
She did so well-dechu!

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:42.400
So much tension, I'm tired from just watching-kuma!

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:44.940
I was totally fine-usa!

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:47.110
Falulu is good at studying-usa.

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:51.260
Rumor has it she can recite her times tables up to five billion-nekon.

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:52.950
W-Well...

00:09:56.290 --> 00:10:00.880
Since awakening, she's only become able to do up to her three times tables-dechu...

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:02.730
Eh!?

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:05.510
Who wants to come up and solve this?

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:06.980
Me!

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:08.430
Me me me!

00:10:08.430 --> 00:10:10.520
Then... Falulu-san!

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:15.780
She'll probably show them a Making Drama called "arithmetic".

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:19.610
Since when have you guys been inspecting?

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:21.450
Falulu, don't give up!

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:28.270
The answer is "1"! Capisce!

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:30.800
Idiots get out-dechu!

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:32.210
The answer is "3"!

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:36.170
3, 3, 3!

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:43.230
So many 3s, lots of 3s.

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:46.330
Brackets, 0, U and V.

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:49.810
Write 3, 3 over here.

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:52.920
And, it's Falulu!

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:54.610
Falulu's song and picture!

00:10:54.610 --> 00:10:55.880
It looks just like her!

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:58.340
Correct, Falulu-dechu...

00:10:58.580 --> 00:10:59.700
Wow!

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:00.960
That's art right there!

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:03.540
Art! Da Vinci!

00:11:03.870 --> 00:11:05.860
Wait... My sentence enders...

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:12.420
My friend's friend's friend's pet hamster.

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:21.940
Oh my, it's not art class now, it's math.

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:23.010
Okay!

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:26.100
This is where the real battle starts.

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:29.260
Falulu should only get better from here.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.280
Since when did you...

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:33.330
We have permission.

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:34.120
Glo!

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:41.040
This one looks strong, and this one looks cute!

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:46.220
This one is flexible!

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:48.120
Lala.

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:51.330
Give this to Falulu.

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:53.590
It's from Takahashi-kun.

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:57.210
Note from Takahashi-kun.

00:11:58.590 --> 00:11:59.610
What?

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:03.780
Let's play dodgeball at recess!

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:08.280
Yes, let's play!

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:10.610
Falulu be quiet!

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:15.100
Falulu, Takahashi-kun, we're in class!

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:16.680
Sorry.

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:20.550
Class inspection! That's also a four character idiom!

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:22.600
Falulu, hang in there!

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:25.430
They just keep coming...

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:27.330
Falulu!

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:30.530
You're supposed to eat your lunch early during class!

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:33.360
No you aren't!

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:38.610
Dorothy, you can't do that!

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:40.230
Here's a rule violation ticket!

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:53.250
Falulu, what's the equation to find the area of this triangle?

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:53.860
Okay!

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:57.690
Falulu, keep it up!

00:12:57.690 --> 00:12:59.140
Why is Chiri here?

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:00.580
I told her about it.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:03.470
I feel a little bad.

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.260
What about your school?

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:07.650
Ah, you bunked off didn't you?

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:10.770
Today is Founding Day, so I don't have to go.

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:12.790
That's a handy coincidence huh?

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:14.410
Yes it is.

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:23.810
They won't be able to do the class if they come!

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:32.070
Pepper, Falulu is in class, so please be quiet, okay?

00:13:32.180 --> 00:13:34.980
You're the one who beat the King of Sapana!

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:37.220
Duel me!

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:46.340
Good girl, who's the cutest?

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:50.570
Falulu, think deeply!

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:51.720
Stay in there!

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:54.590
The answer is base over height!

00:13:54.590 --> 00:13:55.620
Times two-garu!

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:59.550
If we split this rice ball, we get triangle ones-nano!

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:00.680
Correct, da-!

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:03.690
Garuru is there too!?

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:05.650
S-Since when...?

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:09.360
I'm so happy to be at school with Aroma and Mikan-garu!

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:19.740
I'm so happy for you Garuru-dechu!

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:25.210
Next is the expansion method...

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:29.890
Bracket A, closed with bracket B

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:33.990
and timesed by C, the equation is like...

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:36.800
Oh no, she's getting near her limit!

00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:40.700
There's not long until class ends, can she make it?

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:46.330
And this is how we expand them...

00:14:46.590 --> 00:14:47.980
Just a little longer.

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:53.140
If you do, you'll go from my friend's friend's friend's hamster, to

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:57.160
my friend's friend's hamster.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:00.570
Sensei!

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:04.760
Falulu has discovered a new rule!

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:10.380
What rule have you found, Falulu-dechu?

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:14.420
If you make one friend in PriPara.

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:17.930
You can become friends with their friends

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:19.850
and make ten friends!

00:15:21.220 --> 00:15:24.550
Falulu was all alone in PriPara.

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:27.480
But I became friends with Lala, then...

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:31.800
friends with Lala's friends!

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:35.830
They all made me so happy!

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:39.730
Friend's are great!

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:42.710
When Falulu is happy,

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:46.940
my friends are happy.

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:52.570
And happiness gives you courage

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:58.650
and as you get more friends, you get happier

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:00.360
and even more courageous!

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:08.260
Basically, if that first friend is represented by "heart", than "friends = heart x 10."

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:10.430
We can go further,

00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:15.100
if you multiply it by 10 over and over again.

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:20.600
It equals, unlimited "heart!"

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:24.580
And so happiness is infinite!

00:16:24.970 --> 00:16:26.930
And courage too!

00:16:26.930 --> 00:16:28.490
Woah, amazing!

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:32.250
So basically, everyone is friends!

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:35.470
So does that mean we're Falulu's friends?

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:36.810
Of course!

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:37.840
Yeah!

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:40.210
It's true, happiness has spread!

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:44.130
This is called "Falulu's rule!"

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:58.220
Well... done.... da-daVinci...

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:03.100
Today, humanity and mascots have witnessed a theory that

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:08.280
stands up there with Pythagoras' and Archimedes'.

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:12.210
Let's play dodgeball!

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:14.460
Me too!

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:15.680
Me too!

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:21.290
Da Vin...!

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:37.440
Lala, look!

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:43.080
I can see, it's Jululu!

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:47.250
Jululu...

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:51.880
Lala, it looks like my time is up.

00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:56.800
Thanks, it was fun! Please take care of everyone.

00:17:57.260 --> 00:17:57.980
Falulu!

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:06.300
I really wanted to play dodgeball!

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:09.710
We'd just become friends as well...

00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:12.480
I wanted to eat lunch with Garuru-nano!

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:13.370
Dearu.

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:18.350
But we have Falulu's rule now, hearts are infinite!

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:19.910
Capisce!

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:26.160
I'M SORRY I COULDN'T RESIST!

00:18:27.470 --> 00:18:28.360
It's over!

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:31.500
That was so much fun!

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:32.530
Garu!

00:18:32.530 --> 00:18:35.250
I wanted to show her around Parajuku-pri...

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:40.450
That was more than enough, just the fact that

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:43.230
I got to see the outside world has made me love Pripara even more!

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:44.510
Garuru too!

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:49.140
It's great that you got to see Jewlie-kuma.

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:52.320
I heard she became a PriTicket deliverer!

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:54.710
She looked so happy.

00:18:54.950 --> 00:18:56.610
It's perfect for her!

00:18:58.350 --> 00:19:02.370
Jewlie and Janice are definitely watching over us right now.

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:03.290
Of course!

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:05.830
They're supporting us as we speak.

00:19:06.800 --> 00:19:09.860
Jewlie has begun walking down a new path...

00:19:10.650 --> 00:19:12.550
I can't let myself stagnate!

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:16.350
Jewlie, if you can hear this

00:19:16.350 --> 00:19:19.320
give me a present!

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:22.320
Uh, filthy!

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:24.790
What are you doing!?

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:26.540
Dorothy, relax!

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:38.240
I'll treasure the rosette pact forever,

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:40.950
in case Jululu comes back...

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:47.400
Watch, Jululu, mama is still giving it her all!

00:19:48.280 --> 00:19:50.810
Mama, I love you!

00:20:04.990 --> 00:20:06.430
You're trying hard!

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:13.740
Keep going!

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:18.530
Yay!

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:22.940
I hope you have a good dream!

00:20:31.010 --> 00:20:32.130
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:43.050
Nothing unusual with the system today...

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:45.940
Onee-sama, relax.

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:50.970
Lala and the gang are fulfilling their role of Divine Idols.

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:53.780
And everyone else is doing well too.

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:10.940
Oh no!

00:22:11.420 --> 00:22:13.050
Shion's gone-usa!

00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:15.780
She just left this behind.

00:22:16.540 --> 00:22:20.230
I'm going on another warrior pilgrimage.

00:22:21.000 --> 00:22:25.730
This is the path I have chosen to see that Dressing Pafé become Divine Idols next time.

00:22:26.550 --> 00:22:30.160
Because I want to walk together with you two in the future.

00:22:30.850 --> 00:22:36.100
Dorothy, Leona, I'm glad I met you both.

00:22:53.640 --> 00:22:55.140
Is it her first time?

00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:57.130
Let's show her around-pri!

00:22:58.790 --> 00:22:59.810
Hey!

00:23:02.090 --> 00:23:03.730
Welcome to PriPara!

00:23:25.890 --> 00:23:26.960
Excuse me.

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:33.020
Manaka-san, I've been waiting.

00:23:33.320 --> 00:23:34.900
What did you want?

00:23:35.340 --> 00:23:37.300
Although it's sudden...

00:23:38.310 --> 00:23:41.170
You're transferring in the new semester!

00:23:41.540 --> 00:23:45.820
Capi... TRANSFER!?

00:23:46.510 --> 00:23:48.160
Watch us next time!
